          </p>
          <a href="/ar/hot-springs/" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-900">
            Preview Hot Springs Guide →
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
            🏗️
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-black text-[#152438]">See the Business Numbers</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
            Granular retail sales-tax breakdowns, public EV charging counts, and Census ZBP small-business trade density.
          </p>
          <a href="/tx/austin/" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-purple-700 hover:text-purple-900">
            Preview Austin Guide →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Section 6: Tools by Audience (Visit · Live · Business) -->
  <section id="tools" class="py-16 bg-[#F8FAFC] border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-[#152438] tracking-tight">
          Tools to help you decide and plan
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">
          Practical relocation, comparison, and commercial lease calculators tailored to each audience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-blue-100 text-[#1D68F2] flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
              ✈️
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              For Visitors
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-base font-black text-[#152438]">City Shortlist & Trip Scouting</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Save cities locally in your browser shortlist and compare visitor guides side by side.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="/#featured" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-[#1D68F2] hover:text-blue-700 pt-2">
            Explore Verified Guides →
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
              🏡
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              For Movers
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-base font-black text-[#152438]">State Tax & Housing Comparison</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Compare Census median home values, gross rents, and effective property tax rates across peer cities.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="/compare/tx-austin-vs-tn-nashville/" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 hover:text-emerald-900 pt-2">
            Compare Living Metrics →
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">
              💼
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-700 bg-purple-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full">
              For Business
            </span>
            <h3 class="text-base font-black text-[#152438]">Commercial Lease & Breakeven</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Enter your quoted lease rate and calculate the daily customers needed to break even across common trades.
            </p>
          </div>
          <a href="/tools/lease-calculator/" class="inline-flex items-center text-xs font-bold text-purple-700 hover:text-purple-900 pt-2">
            Open Lease Calculator →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Browse Cities by State (Full Directory Access) -->
  <section id="states" class="py-16 bg-[#F8FAFC] border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-[#152438] tracking-tight">
          Browse cities by state
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1">
          Explore state directories across the United States, with verified flagship guides badged at the top of their state.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-3">
        {statesList.map((st) => (
          <a
            href={`/${st.code}/`}
            class="p-3.5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/80 hover:border-[#1D68F2] hover:bg-blue-50/50 hover:shadow-xs transition flex justify-between items-center text-xs"
